@startuml deliverable-lifecycle-state
title WF-03 | Deliverable Lifecycle
hide empty description
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam stateBackgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
top to bottom direction

state PENDING
state SUBMITTED
state CHANGES_REQUESTED
state APPROVED

[*] --> PENDING : / create deliverable from execution plan
PENDING --> SUBMITTED : submit or submitExternal\n[authorized recorder and current revision (BR-57)] / append submission
SUBMITTED --> CHANGES_REQUESTED : decide(REQUEST_CHANGES)\n[authorized Brand, current submission, reason and rounds remaining (BR-58/59)]\n/ store review and increment revision rounds
CHANGES_REQUESTED --> SUBMITTED : submit or submitExternal\n[authorized recorder and current revision (BR-59)] / append replacement
SUBMITTED --> APPROVED : decide(APPROVE)\n[authorized Brand, current submission and complete checklist (BR-58)]\n/ store approval
APPROVED --> SUBMITTED : submit or submitExternal\n[Collaboration still IN_PROGRESS and other submission guards pass]\n/ append replacement

note right of APPROVED
  Publication and KPI are recorded against the current
  submission revision. They do not change Deliverable status.
end note
note left of PENDING
  An ACTIVE Campaign and IN_PROGRESS Collaboration
  are required for submission and review. No terminal
  Deliverable status exists in the schema.
end note
@enduml
